NAME

ulibSetSystemData - Changes system data


SYNOPSIS

void ulibSetSystemData(long AccessType, long Section, long Data)
                             a0              d0          d1


DESCRIPTION

This function alters system information identified by the <AccessType>
parameter.

The <AccessType> parameter may be any one of the #define'd XSD_ codes in
xenolink.h (see ulibGetSystemData for a description of each code).

The <Section> parameter need only be used if necessary (for altering
information such as the lowest message in a message section, the highest
message in a message section, or the highest message scanned by MP in a
message section).

Do NOT attempt to alter information which is marked as READ ONLY.


